# An unknown format specifier in a computed format is DS4004 when the query runs.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| project f = format_datetime(timestamp, strcat('yyyy-', 'QQ'))
---- expected
error[DS4004]: `QQ` is not a datetime format specifier
  --> query:2:15
  |
2 | | project f = format_datetime(timestamp, strcat('yyyy-', 'QQ'))
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ in this call of `format_datetime`
  |
  = note: the specifiers are yyyy, yy, y, MM, M, dd, d, HH, H, hh, h, mm, m, ss, s, f to fffffff, F to FFFFFFF and tt; other characters that are not letters are copied
